; SG-1000 port names for the Disassembler window, in Emulicious' .ports
; format: <hex port> <name> [in|out]; without a direction the name serves
; both. A file of the same name in a project's folder takes its place.
; Only the ports games address by their usual number: mirrors stay numeric.

7F Port_PSG out

BE Port_VDPData
BF Port_VDPAddress out
BF Port_VDPStatus in

DC Port_IOPort1 in
DD Port_IOPort2 in
DE Port_PPI_C
DF Port_PPI_Control out
